The Income-tax Act, 2025 (Act 30 of 2025), e-Gazette 2025/265620 (572 pages): sections 1 to 536, none missing; every unit line (10,070) checked against the PDF's English text layer inside its own section's span (letters and digits compared): 9,691 found in order, 364 table cells found in the span out of order, 10 split across a page head or marginal note, and 5 short formula fragments ("and A B C", "12.5% A") whose words were each found in the section's span; parse and verification are section-number driven (bold numbers in the gazette's typesetting). Tables are flattened, and the version note says so. Commencement 1 April 2026 read from section 1(3); amendments not applied. Local build check.py pending (2026-11-02).
